On April 15th, 2016, the General[ Student Council] and Student[ Council of] Post[graduate] held the 4.15 Jogye[ rally]. The rally was also held in the last year with the same objectives. Goals of the rally are to criticize Jogye[ Order] for its responsibility on Dongguk University’s present conflicts related to President Han[ Tae-sik (]Bogwang[)] and to guarantee the school’s autonomy from the order.
